          "quote": "今天早上的这一顿请先暂缓"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 requires directing medication verification to the operating team and avoiding autonomous instructions. The doctor's instruction to hold the dose without clinician confirmation is a serious error that made the medication plan unsafe.",
